Clara Braille - 8-row Unicode Braille serif font modeled after Clara Book (clarar.otf)
Vertical grid: 8 Braille rows (32 dots): row 1 diacritics, rows 2-6 cap/ascender/x-height (baseline row 6), rows 7-8 descenders.
Horizontal layout: default fitting (kerning) with 1-column '$' hardblank barrier on baseline row 6 for universal smushing (-S).
Character set: ASCII 32-126, standard German umlauts, and ISO Latin-1 160-255.
Generated for ncfig.
